  "project_description": "Submodule of Eulerian that supplies the Eulerian JavaScript datalayer on the Commerce cart page (route commerce_cart.page). It adds scart=1, scartcumul=0 and a products list (each product's UUID as ref, unit price as amount, and quantity) to drupalSettings.eulerian.datalayer for the current user's carts. Requires the base eulerian module (via eulerian_commerce_product) and commerce_cart.",
